Subject: Complaint regarding overdue refund for order {{fact:order_id}}

To,
The Grievance Officer
{{fact:merchant_name}}

Dear Sir/Madam,

I am writing to formally complain about the delayed refund for order {{fact:order_id}} totaling {{fact:refund_amount}} for the purchase of {{fact:amount_paid}} on {{fact:order_date}}.

The item, {{fact:item_description}}, was cancelled or returned on {{fact:cancellation_or_return_date}}. The refund was promised on {{fact:refund_promise_date}} and the expected credit date was {{fact:refund_due_date}}. As of today, {{today}}, the status of the transaction is still {{fact:refund_received}}.

I request you to process this pending refund immediately.

Kindly register my complaint and share the complaint number for reference.

Yours sincerely,
{{you:name}}
{{you:contact}}
{{you:address}}
